# `.ignore` -- Show hidden directories to the CodeChat Editor
# ===========================================================
#
# The CodeChat Editor's project cache walks the project with the
# [ignore](https://docs.rs/ignore) crate, which skips hidden files and
# directories unless an ignore file whitelists them. These directories contain
# fragments gathered elsewhere in the project, such as the calls to `bt`
# gathered in `docs/implementation.md`. ripgrep honors this file as well.
